sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant H as HTTP Adapter
    participant A as Consumer Application
    participant CA as Contract Adapter
    participant P as Provider
    C->>H: request plus authentication facts
    H->>H: create trace, correlation, operation, tenant scope
    H->>A: trusted ExecutionContext
    A->>CA: Port call
    CA->>CA: create fresh RequestId and ContractRequestContext
    CA->>P: versioned minimum context
    P->>P: validate consumer, version, scope, actor/source, tenant
    P-->>CA: stable result code
    CA-->>A: transport-neutral result
    A-->>H: safe result
    H-->>C: stable error code plus CorrelationId
